OL,3,AExpedition hopes to find aviator Amelia
OL,4,AEarhart's plane on remote island
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team of researchers are on their way
OL,7,Fto a remote island to inspect what they
OL,8,Fthink could be the wreckage of famed
OL,9,Faviator Amelia Earhart's plane.
OL,11,FThe group, from the US-based
OL,12,FArchaeological Legacy Institute (ALI)
OL,13,Fand Purdue University, are expected to
OL,14,Farrive at Nikumaroro Island in the
OL,15,FPacific Ocean by Monday in the hopes of
OL,16,Fsolving the mystery of her
OL,17,Fdisappearance.
OL,19,FThe American pioneer vanished while
OL,20,Fattempting to circumnavigate the globe
OL,21,Fin 1937, spawning decades of
OL,22,Fspeculation on her fate.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
