OL,3,AExpedition hopes to find aviator Amelia
OL,4,AEarhart's plane on remote island
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team are aiming to find what has
OL,7,Fbeen called the Taraia Object, first
OL,8,Fspotted sitting on the edge of a lagoon
OL,9,Foff Nikumaroro in satellite imagery in
OL,10,F2020.
